SUMMARY:The Wild Bunch at Strasburg Rail Road
DESCRIPTION:The Wild Bunch: A High-Stakes Heritage Adventure\n\nPrepare for a thrilling journey into the heart of the Old West as the legendary outlaws Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid bring their high-stakes drama to the rails of America’s oldest continuously operating railroad. This summer\, the legacy of the Strasburg Rail Road meets the grit and gunfire of the frontier in an action-packed historical production that plays out both on our “town square” stage and aboard our historic early 20th-century steam train. As you steam through 2\,500 acres of picturesque Amish countryside\, the notorious Wild Bunch sets their sights on a daring heist\, but a group of determined Pinkerton agents is hot on their trail. Witness a battle of wits and honor as Butch Cassidy struggles to maintain his legendary code in this heart-pounding\, immersive experience. A World-Class Performance: Our production features a professional\, costumed cast with global credits ranging from Warner Bros. and Celebrity Cruises to premier local stages like the Fulton Theatre and Sight & Sound.\n\nYour Experience Includes:\n\nPre-Boarding Act: The excitement begins at 5:45 PM with a specialized performance at the station before our 6:00 PM departure.\n\n45-Minute Narrated Journey: An immersive train ride through the historic Lancaster County corridor.\n\nFull Theatrical Production: Integrated pre-show\, on-board\, and post-show performances.\n\nDon’t miss this soon-to-be fan favorite\, playing Fridays\, Saturdays\, and select Sundays from July 4 through August 30\, 2026. Please plan to arrive early for check-in to ensure you don’t miss a moment of the action.\n\n\nATTENTION: Please note that all Dinner on the Rail passengers must be age 21 or older with a proper photo ID to board the train. Each guest will be carded\, pursuant to state law. In addition\, in accordance with Pennsylvania law\, alcohol can only be served during the train ride. Alcoholic drinks must be consumed before exiting the train; alcohol is not permitted off the train. Strasburg Rail Road is not permitted to serve alcoholic drinks while the train is berthed in the Station.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/wild-bunch-strasburg-rail-road/
LOCATION:Strasburg Rail Road\, 301 Gap Road\, Ronks\, PA\, 17572\, United States
CATEGORIES:Railroad,Strasburg, PA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/strasburg-rail-road-event-wild-bunch.webp
GEO:39.9830724;-76.1597641
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Strasburg Rail Road 301 Gap Road Ronks PA 17572 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=301 Gap Road:geo:-76.1597641,39.9830724
END:VEVENT
