SUMMARY:Pretty Woman The Musical - Dutch Apple Dinner Theatre
DESCRIPTION:If you love the movie\, you’ll love the musical! This modern Cinderella tale follows a business man who hires an escort to spend the weekend with him. As the weekend unfolds\, the two embark on an unexpected journey of self-discovery and find true love along the way. PG13 \nApproximate Run Time: 2 Hours and 30 Minutes\n  \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
