SUMMARY:Softball Stormer Player Camp at Penn Medicine Park
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a one-of-a-kind experience at the Stormer Player-Run Softball Camp! This camp\, led by current Stormer players\, is perfect for young athletes ages 7-14 who want to learn the fundamentals of the game from the pros themselves. Participants will sharpen their skills\, play exciting games\, and get up-close coaching from players who know what it takes to succeed on the field.  \nThe camp focuses on developing core softball fundamentals like hitting\, fielding\, throwing\, and base running. Through hands-on instruction\, fun drills\, and competitive games\, players will have the opportunity to learn directly from Stormer athletes\, gaining insights into the techniques and strategies used at the highest levels of the game. Day two and three will feature fun scrimmages to put their skills to the test in a real-game setting!  \nJoin us for exciting\, skill-building softball camps where players of all levels will enhance their abilities in every aspect of the game! \nParticipants will focus on key fundamentals such as hitting\, pitching\, fielding\, base running\, and throwing. Through instruction from the Stormers Softball coaching staff and fun drills\, players will progressively build their skills and gain confidence on the field\, setting the foundation for success in competitive play. Train like the Stormers! \nSoftball Camps are run by Jackie Wardrop and Brionna Rinier! \nRuns: 9:00 am – 12:00 Noon \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/softball-stormer-player-camp-penn-medicine-park/
LOCATION:Penn Medicine Park\, 650 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603
CATEGORIES:Children & Family Events,Community Interest,Lancaster City,Outdoor Activities,Summer Camp
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Penn-Medicine-Park-Event-Softball-Camp.png
